---
title: "revoke_user_consent (stem-system: User Consent Revocation)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: supabase.auth.getUser()
    q_auth --> q_no_auth: no user
    q_auth --> q_delete: user present
    q_no_auth --> [*]: return 401 Unauthorized
    q_delete --> q_rpc: rpc delete_user_consent(consent_id, user_id)
    q_rpc --> q_error: error
    q_rpc --> q_success: success
    q_error --> [*]: return 500 failed to revoke
    q_success --> [*]: return success=true

    note right of q_rpc
        INV-001: user can only delete their own consent (user_id filter in RPC)
    end note
